1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,923
第二部分是客座讲座
Part 2 is the guest lecture.

2
00:00:03,243 --> 00:00:08,086
它围绕一个小型机器学习项目 babykev 搭起同样的门禁
It builds the same gate around a small machine learning project, babykev,

3
00:00:08,086 --> 00:00:12,663
babykev 回答关于奶酪的问题，还会报告自己有多大把握
which answers questions about cheese and reports how confident it is;

4
00:00:12,663 --> 00:00:14,720
纯粹的猜测应该得零分
a pure guess should score zero.

5
00:00:15,040 --> 00:00:16,960
直到最后才用到 Docker
No Docker until the very end.

6
00:00:17,280 --> 00:00:23,517
先装两个工具，作为额外步骤：第 2 讲的包管理器 uv
Two tools first, as extras: the package manager uv from lecture 2,

7
00:00:23,517 --> 00:00:30,037
录制时是 0.13.2；还有命令运行器 just，1.59.0
0.13.2 at the time of recording, and the command runner just, 1.59.0.

8
00:00:30,283 --> 00:00:32,689
先 clone babykev，再列出它的 tag
Clone babykev and list its tags:

9
00:00:32,689 --> 00:00:35,019
一共 9 步，课上每个阶段一步
9 steps, one per lecture stage.

10
00:00:35,339 --> 00:00:37,658
这个 repo 本身就是一套幻灯片
The repo is its own slide deck,

11
00:00:37,658 --> 00:00:41,099
用 git switch --detach 就能跳到任意一步
and git switch --detach moves you to any step.

12
00:00:41,419 --> 00:00:42,917
暂停一下，两条都跑一遍
Pause and run both.

13
00:00:42,967 --> 00:00:49,004
在 step-00，一条命令就建好环境：uv sync --locked
At step-00, one command builds the environment: uv sync --locked.

14
00:00:49,324 --> 00:00:55,746
它安装 Python 3.13.16 和项目本身，完全按 lock 文件写的来
It installs Python 3.13.16 and the project exactly as the lockfile says.

15
00:00:56,066 --> 00:00:58,882
加上 --locked，意思是宁可停下，也不悄悄升级
Locked means stop rather than silently upgrade.

16
00:00:59,202 --> 00:01:02,103
录制时它打印的那条警告是无害的
Its warning is harmless, at the time of recording.

17
00:01:02,423 --> 00:01:04,645
前面 cheese 的 repo 冻结的是 image
The cheese repo froze an image;

18
00:01:04,645 --> 00:01:06,473
而 babykev pin 住的是 lock 文件
babykev pins a lockfile.

19
00:01:06,626 --> 00:01:09,352
单独输入 just，会列出所有 recipe
Typing just, alone, lists the recipes:

20
00:01:09,352 --> 00:01:12,940
每个任务一个名字，人、hook，以及之后的 CI 都用它
one name per task, for people, hook, and later CI.

21
00:01:13,260 --> 00:01:14,750
暂停一下，把这些都跑一遍
Pause and run these.

22
00:01:14,800 --> 00:01:17,424
到了 step-01，加进来的是契约和它的测试
Step 1 brings the contract and its tests.

23
00:01:17,744 --> 00:01:22,800
运行 uv run pytest：2 failed, 50 passed，而且测试是对的
Run uv run pytest: 2 failed, 50 passed, and the tests are right.

24
00:01:23,120 --> 00:01:27,684
一个失败是纯粹的猜测被打成了一半的把握
One failure is a pure guess scored as half confident;

25
00:01:27,684 --> 00:01:32,421
另一个是 77 个四舍五入后的概率，加起来只有 0.77
the other is 77 rounded probabilities that sum to 0.77.

26
00:01:32,741 --> 00:01:36,432
和 cheese 的演示同一条规则：改代码，不改测试
Same rule as the cheese demo: fix the code, not the tests.

27
00:01:36,752 --> 00:01:38,100
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

28
00:01:38,150 --> 00:01:40,429
接着 step-02：大规模的格式化和 lint
Step 2 is format and lint at scale,

29
00:01:40,429 --> 00:01:42,029
ruff 一个工具兼两个角色
ruff in both roles.

30
00:01:42,225 --> 00:01:45,233
格式化之后，linter 数出 70 个问题
After formatting, the linter counts 70 findings.

31
00:01:45,553 --> 00:01:47,857
安全的自动修复去掉了一个
Safe automatic fixes remove one.

32
00:01:48,177 --> 00:01:52,317
有意识地用上不安全的修复，又去掉 32 个
Unsafe fixes, applied deliberately, remove 32 more;

33
00:01:52,317 --> 00:01:54,833
剩下 37 个，这些得靠人
37 remain; those need a person.

34
00:01:55,153 --> 00:01:58,952
第一部分的宽度之争，用一行就解决了
And the width war from part 1 is settled in one line,

35
00:01:58,952 --> 00:02:02,537
line-length 设成 100，在 pyproject.toml 里只写一次
line-length = 100, written once in pyproject.toml;

36
00:02:02,537 --> 00:02:05,691
格式化工具和 linter 都照它来
the formatter and the linter both follow it.

37
00:02:07,533 --> 00:02:10,346
到了 step-03，用一个 recipe 装好门禁
Step 3 installs the gate with one recipe,

38
00:02:10,346 --> 00:02:13,912
just setup，同步 lock 文件和安装 hook 一起完成
just setup: lockfile sync and hook install together.

39
00:02:14,232 --> 00:02:15,654
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

40
00:02:15,704 --> 00:02:18,499
按 walk.md，下一条命令打印出这个 hook 文件
The walk's next command prints the hook file:

41
00:02:18,499 --> 00:02:21,976
和前面一样的交接链，只有一处不同
the same hand-over chain as before, with one difference.

42
00:02:22,296 --> 00:02:25,108
里面写死了这台机器自己的 venv 路径
This machine's own venv path is baked inside,

43
00:02:25,108 --> 00:02:26,708
所以它永远不会被 commit
so it is never committed.

44
00:02:26,916 --> 00:02:29,906
这里的配置只有四个 hook，不是九个
The config here has four hooks, not nine:

45
00:02:29,906 --> 00:02:34,645
大文件、合并冲突标记、一个拒绝任何 .env 文件的策略 hook
large files, merge markers, a policy hook refusing any .env file,

46
00:02:34,645 --> 00:02:37,561
还有一个运行 just check 的本地 hook
and one local hook that runs just check.

47
00:02:37,881 --> 00:02:40,164
所以 hook 跑的正是你自己敲的那条命令
So the hook runs exactly what you type.

48
00:02:40,484 --> 00:02:43,404
在这一步，just check 包括格式检查和 lint
At this step, just check means format check,

49
00:02:43,404 --> 00:02:47,716
还有带 90% 覆盖率下限的测试，以及配置文件的 lint
lint, tests with a 90 percent coverage floor, and config linting.

50
00:02:48,216 --> 00:02:53,784
运行 just check：全部是绿的，覆盖率 100%，高于 90% 的下限
Run just check: everything green, coverage 100 percent over a floor of 90.

51
00:02:54,104 --> 00:02:58,541
现在看它咬人：只跑 confidence 相关的测试，下限不变
Now watch it bite: ask for only the confidence tests, keeping the floor.

52
00:02:58,861 --> 00:03:02,727
9 个测试通过，一半的代码根本没跑到
9 tests pass, half the code is never exercised,

53
00:03:02,727 --> 00:03:06,264
这次运行以 49.4% 的覆盖率失败
and the run fails at 49.4 percent coverage.

54
00:03:06,584 --> 00:03:08,525
下限是门禁，不是目标
A floor is a gate, not a goal.

55
00:03:08,845 --> 00:03:10,333
暂停一下，两条都跑一遍
Pause and run both.

56
00:03:10,383 --> 00:03:14,884
配置文件也要检查：hook 配置一坏，每次 commit 都会坏
Config files are checked too: a broken hook config breaks every commit.

57
00:03:15,204 --> 00:03:18,022
在 pre-commit 配置里缩进错一处
One wrong indent in the pre-commit config,

58
00:03:18,022 --> 00:03:20,303
yamllint 就会指出具体是哪一行
and yamllint names the exact line.

59
00:03:20,623 --> 00:03:23,116
恢复之后，这个 recipe 跑绿了
Restored, the recipe runs green;

60
00:03:23,116 --> 00:03:27,556
它还会校验 pyproject.toml，检查 lock 文件
it also validates pyproject.toml and checks the lockfile.

61
00:03:27,800 --> 00:03:31,384
现在门禁要拒绝了，两次；暂停一下，试试第一次
Now the gate refuses, twice; pause and try the first.

62
00:03:31,704 --> 00:03:33,821
加进一个没用到的 import
An unused import goes in;

63
00:03:33,821 --> 00:03:37,293
commit 在 F401 上失败，没有生成 commit
the commit fails on F401, no commit made.

64
00:03:37,613 --> 00:03:42,916
接着暂存一个 .env 文件，拒绝的理由就是配置里自己写的那句话
Then a .env file is staged, and the refusal is the config's own sentence:

65
00:03:42,916 --> 00:03:47,128
.env 文件装的是一台机器的设置和密钥
a .env file holds the settings and secrets of one machine.

66
00:03:47,448 --> 00:03:49,048
它永远不能 commit
It is never committed.

67
00:03:51,050 --> 00:03:55,465
两种门禁风格，都没问题：这个只指出问题，由你来跑 just fmt
Two gate styles, both fine: this one points and you run just fmt;

68
00:03:55,465 --> 00:03:58,453
cheese 的门禁直接改写，再逼你看一眼
the cheese gate rewrites and makes you look.

69
00:03:58,773 --> 00:04:02,440
接下来 step-04 和 step-04b 把文档放进门禁
Steps 4 and 4b put documentation in the gate:

70
00:04:02,440 --> 00:04:07,898
一开始 88 个函数、方法和类里有 50 个带类型标注和文档
first 50 of 88 functions, methods and classes typed and documented,

71
00:04:07,898 --> 00:04:09,854
下一步是 88 个全都有
one step later 88 of 88;

72
00:04:09,854 --> 00:04:13,194
删掉一条说明就会拦下 commit
deleting one description blocks a commit.

73
00:04:13,514 --> 00:04:15,199
表里又多了两行
Two rows join the table.

74
00:04:18,750 --> 00:04:20,849
到了 step-05，模型来了
Step 5 brings the model:

75
00:04:20,849 --> 00:04:24,610
setup 这个 recipe 现在会拉下整套模型依赖
the setup recipe now pulls the model stack,

76
00:04:24,610 --> 00:04:30,995
38 个包，包括 CPU 版的 torch 2.14.1，这是录制时的情况
38 packages including torch 2.14.1 for the CPU, at the time of recording.

77
00:04:31,315 --> 00:04:36,201
然后是 just test：92 passed，覆盖率 94%，全绿
Then just test: 92 passed, coverage 94 percent, all green.

78
00:04:36,521 --> 00:04:38,067
暂停一下，两条都跑一遍
Pause and run both.

79
00:04:38,117 --> 00:04:39,717
这个模型做什么？
What does the model do?

80
00:04:39,845 --> 00:04:43,984
一个请求把一段状态和几个问题打包进同一个序列
A request packs one state and several questions into one sequence.

81
00:04:44,304 --> 00:04:45,998
有一个 mask 强制执行一条规则
A mask enforces one rule:

82
00:04:45,998 --> 00:04:50,469
一个问题可以看到状态和它自己，绝不能看到兄弟问题
a question may see the state and itself, never a sibling question.

83
00:04:50,789 --> 00:04:55,930
问题必须各自独立回答；偷看一眼，就会把一个答案泄露进另一个
Questions must be answered independently; a peek would leak one answer into another.

84
00:04:56,250 --> 00:05:00,069
这一个禁止的格子，就是它和 causal mask 的全部区别
That one forbidden cell is the whole difference from a causal mask.

85
00:05:01,583 --> 00:05:04,207
按 walk.md 打印出代码构建的 mask
The walk prints the mask the code builds,

86
00:05:04,207 --> 00:05:07,115
两个状态 token，加两个各有两个 token 的问题
for two state tokens and two questions of two;

87
00:05:07,115 --> 00:05:08,715
暂停一下，打印你自己的
pause and print yours.

88
00:05:08,879 --> 00:05:13,807
第 5 行和第 6 行说明，问题 2 什么都能看到，包括问题 1
Rows 5 and 6 say question 2 sees everything, including question 1.

89
00:05:14,127 --> 00:05:15,639
原因只有一行
The cause is one line:

90
00:05:15,639 --> 00:05:20,037
torch 的 ones like 把每一对 token 都标成同一个问题
torch.ones_like marks every pair of tokens as the same question.

91
00:05:20,283 --> 00:05:24,057
一个检查脚本把构建出的 mask 和我们想要的那个对比
A checker script compares the built mask against the one we meant,

92
00:05:24,057 --> 00:05:25,830
在那几行打印出 WRONG
and prints WRONG on those rows.

93
00:05:26,150 --> 00:05:28,365
可是 just check 里没有任何东西会运行它
But nothing in just check runs it;

94
00:05:28,365 --> 00:05:31,035
靠眼睛看的打印结果不是测试
a printout you read by eye is not a test.

95
00:05:31,355 --> 00:05:32,788
来想一个问题
Something to ponder:

96
00:05:32,788 --> 00:05:37,158
branch mask 里每行代码都跑到了，覆盖率显示 94%
every line of branch_mask ran, and coverage reads 94 percent.

97
00:05:37,478 --> 00:05:39,633
有哪个覆盖率数字能抓到这个 bug 吗？
Can any coverage number catch this bug?

98
00:05:48,467 --> 00:05:54,142
不能。覆盖率数的是跑过的行，从不管有没有人检查它们算出了什么
No. Coverage counts lines that ran, never whether anyone checked what they produced.

99
00:05:54,462 --> 00:05:56,616
必要，但永远不充分
Necessary, and never sufficient.

100
00:05:56,850 --> 00:05:59,319
同样绿着却看不见的，还有类型检查器
Also green and blind: the type checker,

101
00:05:59,319 --> 00:06:02,610
它只读声明的类型，不运行代码
which reads declared types without running the code.

102
00:06:02,930 --> 00:06:06,813
运行 ty，发现 6 条诊断，可 just check 还是绿的
Running ty finds 6 diagnostics, yet just check is green:

103
00:06:06,813 --> 00:06:12,082
类型还没进门禁，而门禁之外的检查谁也保护不了
types are not in the gate yet, and a check outside the gate protects nobody.

104
00:06:12,317 --> 00:06:14,727
最后，在真实模型上跑冒烟测试
Last, the smoke on the real model:

105
00:06:14,727 --> 00:06:19,618
5 亿参数，从 Hugging Face Hub 下载一次
half a billion parameters, downloaded once from the Hugging Face Hub,

106
00:06:19,618 --> 00:06:23,730
这是一个公开的模型托管平台，在 CPU 上回答 15 个奶酪问题
a public model host, answering 15 cheese questions on CPU.

107
00:06:24,050 --> 00:06:27,698
第一次运行要下载大约 1 GB；暂停一下，自己跑一遍
The first run downloads about a gigabyte; pause and run it.

108
00:06:28,018 --> 00:06:29,618
15 个里答对了 6 个
6 of 15 right.

109
00:06:29,832 --> 00:06:33,138
什么都没训练，这些都是猜的；先记住这个数字
Nothing is trained, these are guesses; hold that number.

110
00:06:34,783 --> 00:06:37,556
到了 step-05a，用真正能看出问题的测试来回应
Step 5a answers with tests that could tell.

111
00:06:37,876 --> 00:06:39,066
先说实话
First, honesty:

112
00:06:39,066 --> 00:06:43,188
在这台机器上，just test 显示 1 failed, 102 passed
on this machine just test says 1 failed, 102 passed.

113
00:06:43,508 --> 00:06:49,780
失败的那个测试改动一个问题，要求其他问题的答案逐位不变
The failing test changes one question and demands that the other answers stay bit for bit equal.

114
00:06:50,100 --> 00:06:51,600
在这台 Linux 的 CPU 上
On this Linux CPU,

115
00:06:51,600 --> 00:06:55,586
torch 求和的顺序和作者的 Mac 不一样
torch sums in a different order than the author's Mac;

116
00:06:55,586 --> 00:06:58,634
在 Mac 上 103 个全部通过，walk.md 里有记录
there all 103 pass, as the walk records.

117
00:06:58,954 --> 00:07:02,067
所谓 hermetic，是只有你的代码能让它失败
Hermetic means only your code can make it fail;

118
00:07:02,067 --> 00:07:05,511
跨机器逐位一致是一个更强的承诺
bit exactness across machines is a stronger promise;

119
00:07:05,511 --> 00:07:07,167
这台机器把它量了出来
this machine measured it.

120
00:07:07,416 --> 00:07:08,795
现在说正题
Now the lesson.

121
00:07:08,845 --> 00:07:13,816
故意放进一个错的修复：它只挡住紧挨在前面的那个问题
A deliberately wrong fix goes in, one that blocks only the question just before.

122
00:07:14,136 --> 00:07:17,677
6 个 token 的图说一切正常；它看不出来
The six token picture says all ok; it cannot tell.

123
00:07:17,997 --> 00:07:21,496
4 个 token 的图就能：它的最后一行显示 WRONG
A four token picture can: its last row reads WRONG.

124
00:07:21,733 --> 00:07:23,504
换个办法：把规则写一次
State the rule once instead.

125
00:07:23,824 --> 00:07:28,294
属性测试让 hypothesis 随便抽请求的形状
The property test lets hypothesis draw any request shape:

126
00:07:28,294 --> 00:07:32,528
状态 1 到 6 个 token，最多 4 个问题，每个 1 到 5 个 token
a state of 1 to 6 tokens, up to 4 questions of 1 to 5.

127
00:07:32,848 --> 00:07:38,117
这些尺寸一共允许 4686 种形状，多到没法一张张画图
Those sizes allow 4,686 shapes, too many for pictures.

128
00:07:38,437 --> 00:07:41,594
它断言：任何被允许的一对，都绝不是兄弟问题的一对
It asserts that no allowed pair is ever a sibling pair.

129
00:07:41,914 --> 00:07:44,069
跑之前，先想一个问题
Something to ponder before we run it.

130
00:07:52,916 --> 00:07:55,124
你需要一个往回隔两步的问题
You need a question two steps back,

131
00:07:55,124 --> 00:07:58,719
所以是一个状态 token 加三个各有一个 token 的问题
so one state token and three questions of one token each.

132
00:07:59,039 --> 00:08:01,388
而 hypothesis 自己就找到了
And hypothesis finds it on its own:

133
00:08:01,388 --> 00:08:06,420
这一个测试失败，然后把反例收缩成正好这个形状
the one test fails, then shrinks the counter example to exactly that shape.

134
00:08:06,740 --> 00:08:08,162
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

135
00:08:08,212 --> 00:08:12,607
属性测试不只是说不；它还把最小的证据交到你手上
A property test does not only say no; it hands you the smallest witness.

136
00:08:12,850 --> 00:08:14,584
来证明门禁长了牙
Proof the gate grew teeth:

137
00:08:14,584 --> 00:08:18,053
把 step-05 那行错的 mask 放回去，再运行 just test
put step 5's wrong mask line back and run just test;

138
00:08:18,053 --> 00:08:19,456
暂停一下，试一试
pause and try it.

139
00:08:19,506 --> 00:08:24,327
8 failed, 95 passed；之前一路放行的代码，现在被拒绝了
8 failed, 95 passed; code that sailed through before is refused.

140
00:08:24,647 --> 00:08:27,463
门禁只能拒绝它的测试看得见的东西
A gate refuses only what its tests can see.

141
00:08:27,783 --> 00:08:32,242
真正的修复只有一行：同一个问题，意思是同一个 segment ID
The real fix is one line: same question means same segment ID.

142
00:08:32,483 --> 00:08:34,056
类型检查也进了门禁
Types join the gate too:

143
00:08:34,056 --> 00:08:37,987
新的 recipe just types 通过了，check 现在有六行
the new recipe, just types, passes, and check has six lines.

144
00:08:38,307 --> 00:08:40,270
那换上正确的 mask，冒烟测试呢？
And the smoke, with the right mask?

145
00:08:40,590 --> 00:08:42,830
15 个里答对 4 个，比之前还低
4 of 15, lower than before.

146
00:08:43,150 --> 00:08:44,750
暂停一下，跑一下冒烟测试
Pause and run the smoke.

147
00:08:44,984 --> 00:08:48,035
之前的 6 是运气；没训练过的模型，分数说明不了什么
The 6 was luck; an untrained score means nothing.

148
00:08:49,683 --> 00:08:53,096
到了 step-05b，不 hermetic 的测试有了一个诚实的家
Step 5b gives non-hermetic tests an honest home.

149
00:08:53,416 --> 00:08:56,269
新加的真实模型测试标上了 system
A new real model test is marked system,

150
00:08:56,269 --> 00:08:59,780
配置默认把这个 marker 排除在外
and the config deselects that marker by default:

151
00:08:59,780 --> 00:09:03,144
每次 just test 都显示 1 deselected，这是有意的
every just test says 1 deselected, on purpose.

152
00:09:03,383 --> 00:09:07,895
明确要求时，just test -m system 显示 1 passed
Asked for explicitly, just test -m system says 1 passed,

153
00:09:07,895 --> 00:09:13,132
103 deselected：真实模型确实跑了，而且它必须通过，不能跳过
103 deselected: the real model ran, and it had to pass, not skip.

154
00:09:13,452 --> 00:09:16,524
这就是第一部分那次悄悄跳过的诚实版本
That is the honest version of part 1's silent skip.

155
00:09:16,844 --> 00:09:18,551
暂停一下，两种写法都跑一遍
Pause and run both forms.

156
00:09:18,800 --> 00:09:20,573
门禁里又多了几行小的
Smaller rows join the gate:

157
00:09:20,573 --> 00:09:23,003
hadolint 对 Dockerfile 做 lint，结果干净
hadolint lints the Dockerfile, clean.

158
00:09:23,323 --> 00:09:27,018
第二部分是在一台没有 Docker 的普通机器上录的
Part 2 was recorded on a plain machine without Docker,

159
00:09:27,018 --> 00:09:29,003
所以这些 recipe 礼貌地失败了
so the recipes fail politely:

160
00:09:29,003 --> 00:09:31,329
docker build 报 command not found
docker build is command not found,

161
00:09:31,329 --> 00:09:33,861
构建 image 的 recipe 也会说明原因
and the image recipe explains itself.

162
00:09:34,181 --> 00:09:36,668
在你装了 Docker Desktop 的笔记本上
On your laptop, with Docker Desktop,

163
00:09:36,668 --> 00:09:38,533
两个 image 都会真正构建出来
both images build for real.

164
00:09:38,853 --> 00:09:40,688
剩下的看 walk.md 里的记录
The walk's record shows the rest.

165
00:09:41,008 --> 00:09:46,555
同一个 lock 文件生成两个 image，1.15 GB 和 1.84 GB
Two images from one lockfile, 1.15 and 1.84 gigabytes.

166
00:09:46,875 --> 00:09:50,958
而且 just check 在一个断网的 container 里也跑绿了
And just check runs green inside a container with no network:

167
00:09:50,958 --> 00:09:53,701
hermetic 的说法，用实验证明了
the hermetic claim, proved by experiment.

168
00:09:53,950 --> 00:09:58,323
门禁表填满了：六行，系统测试在闸机外面
The gate table is full: six rows, system outside the turnstile.

169
00:09:58,643 --> 00:10:00,001
再说局限
Now the limit.

170
00:10:00,051 --> 00:10:02,004
一个 hook 只在一台机器上运行
A hook runs on one machine,

171
00:10:02,004 --> 00:10:05,619
而 git commit --no-verify 能直接绕过它
and git commit --no-verify walks straight past it.

172
00:10:07,583 --> 00:10:12,368
所以 CI 在一台谁也绕不过的服务器上，把同样的检查再跑一遍
So CI re-runs the same checks on a server nobody can skip:

173
00:10:12,368 --> 00:10:15,668
就是同一个 repo 的 Part 5，第 21 讲
part 5 of this same repo, in lecture 21.

174
00:10:15,988 --> 00:10:17,568
也正因为这样
It is also why the hook,

175
00:10:17,568 --> 00:10:20,860
hook、CI 和 README 应该用同一套写法来写这些检查
CI and the README should spell the checks one way;

176
00:10:20,860 --> 00:10:23,690
cheese 的 repo 还没完全做到
the cheese repo does not quite manage that.

177
00:10:24,010 --> 00:10:27,679
所有人用同一条命令，这是你做 milestone 时要带走的经验
One command for everyone is the lesson for your milestone.

178
00:10:27,999 --> 00:10:31,912
覆盖率下限一句话说完：babykev 选了 90
Coverage floors in one line: babykev chose 90;

179
00:10:31,912 --> 00:10:34,378
milestone 5 要求至少 70
milestone 5 asks at least 70.

180
00:10:36,017 --> 00:10:37,681
回顾之前，先清理
Before the recap, clean up.

181
00:10:38,001 --> 00:10:39,839
README 的 Docker 清理
The README's Docker cleanup:

182
00:10:39,839 --> 00:10:43,910
docker container ls 显示没有在运行的，所以不用停
docker container ls shows nothing running, so nothing to stop.

183
00:10:44,230 --> 00:10:46,667
然后是 docker system prune，输入 y
Then docker system prune; type y:

184
00:10:46,667 --> 00:10:51,100
清掉了大约 95 MB 的构建缓存，这是录制时的数字
about 95 megabytes of build cache, at the time of recording.

185
00:10:51,420 --> 00:10:55,174
最后 docker image ls 显示两个 cheese 的 image
A final docker image ls shows the two cheese images.

186
00:10:55,494 --> 00:10:58,801
一个额外步骤把 hook 卸掉：pre-commit uninstall
One extra undoes the hook: pre-commit uninstall.

187
00:10:59,121 --> 00:11:01,603
在 babykev 那边，删掉 venv
On the babykev side, delete the venv;

188
00:11:01,603 --> 00:11:03,281
如果跑过冒烟测试
and if you ran the smoke,

189
00:11:03,281 --> 00:11:06,972
再删掉 Hugging Face 缓存里那个大约 1 GB 的模型
the roughly 1 gigabyte model in the Hugging Face cache.

190
00:11:07,292 --> 00:11:12,134
今天没有任何计费：门禁就在你的笔记本上，这正是重点
Nothing today was billable: the gate lives on your laptop, and that is the point.

191
00:11:12,384 --> 00:11:14,389
五道自测题
5 questions to test yourself.

192
00:11:14,709 --> 00:11:18,516
第一题：cheese 应用的单元测试、集成测试和系统测试
One: what runs in a unit, an integration and a system test of the cheese app, file by file?

193
00:11:18,516 --> 00:11:20,725
逐个文件说说，分别运行了什么？
One: what runs in a unit, an integration and a system test of the cheese app, file by file?

194
00:11:21,045 --> 00:11:24,181
第二题：系统测试在完全没有服务器的情况下也通过了
Two: the system tests pass with no server at all.

195
00:11:24,501 --> 00:11:26,425
这时 pytest 实际打印了什么
What does pytest actually print,

196
00:11:26,425 --> 00:11:28,469
这四个测试又是不是 hermetic 的？
and are those four tests hermetic?

197
00:11:28,717 --> 00:11:31,983
第三题：pre-commit install 到底创建了什么
Three: what does pre-commit install actually create,

198
00:11:31,983 --> 00:11:34,370
为什么每个 clone 都要重新运行它？
and why must every clone run it again?

199
00:11:34,690 --> 00:11:37,784
第四题：black 显示 Failed，files were modified
Four: black says failed, files were modified.

200
00:11:38,104 --> 00:11:40,642
你的代码坏了吗，接下来该做什么？
Is your code broken, and what do you do next?

201
00:11:40,962 --> 00:11:45,293
第五题：babykev 有 94% 的覆盖率，mask 却是错的
Five: babykev had 94 percent coverage and a wrong mask.

202
00:11:45,613 --> 00:11:49,986
最后是哪一类测试看到了这个 bug，覆盖率又为什么看不见它？
What kind of test finally saw the bug, and why was coverage blind to it?

203
00:11:50,517 --> 00:11:55,210
答案在练习里，每条命令都在学习指南里
The answers are in the exercises, and every command is in the study guide.

204
00:11:55,530 --> 00:11:57,869
下节课会用到云上的凭据
Next lecture brings cloud credentials,

205
00:11:57,869 --> 00:12:00,885
到时 detect-private-key 这个 hook 就派上用场了
where the detect-private-key hook earns its keep.

206
00:12:01,205 --> 00:12:05,564
到了第 21 讲，这个 repo 的检查会在 GitHub 上运行
And in lecture 21, this very repo's checks run on GitHub,

207
00:12:05,564 --> 00:12:09,312
在那里谁也没法用 --no-verify 绕过去
where nobody can walk past them with --no-verify.
